  {
   "index": 5,
   "start": 77.233,
   "duration": 16.63,
   "end": 93.863,
   "text": "Do that at every length. [pause 0.9] Then weight each one by p, how often eruptions last that long, and add it all up. [pause 0.3] Where the bell rises above the data, [pause 0.45] the grey dips pay a little back. [pause 0.5] That's the divergence: the same point seven six.",
